      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OHHEMMJAY CRESCO (7) is in good form and looks close to a win following back-to-back placings in Victoria. Raced wide and worked but stuck on for second at his latest appearance at Swan Hill. May need a bit of luck negotiating a very wide starting position but should be peaking now. JOLTED LOVER (2) went back last start but worked home in good style to finish just 4.5 metres from the winner in third at this circuit and distance, making it back-to-back placings. Long-time maiden but she draws well and the breakthrough could be imminent. GLAMOUR FOX (8) cops a wide draw but produced a good effort last time out when beaten narrowly into third at this circuit and distance. NOTTADOUBT (4) hasn't been too far off the placegetters of late and returns to the front row.",
